entities.YaoiHelper/ShaderMask.placements.description.main=here be dragons

entities.YaoiHelper/BuildRegion.placements.name.main=Build Allowed Region
entities.YaoiHelper/BuildRegion.placements.description.main=When placed, restricts building (using Build Controller or the Build Anywhere mod setting) to the area within it.
entities.YaoiHelper/BuildRegion.attributes.description.prevent_building_when_inside=Whether or not the player should be barred from building anywhere when inside this entity.

entities.YaoiHelper/EntityIDShaderMask.placements.name.main=Entity ID Shader Mask
entities.YaoiHelper/EntityIDShaderMask.placements.description.main=Renders entities specified by their ID to a mask group.
